{"5122100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Carnosis", "steam_appid": 5122100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Limb Dismemberment &amp; Status Synergies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/056e6d1cafafe03497a5404b84955c37.poster.avif?t=1787347577\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/056e6d1cafafe03497a5404b84955c37.webm?t=1787347577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/056e6d1cafafe03497a5404b84955c37.mp4?t=1787347577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target distinct enemy limbs to disable their attacks. Build complex party synergies using stackable status effects: trigger mass bleed detonations, freeze targets solid, or unleash nukes that wipe the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal the Flesh of Your Foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/e3f7ff0ef07e96047eae1ae2f2f75b9a.poster.avif?t=1787347577\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/e3f7ff0ef07e96047eae1ae2f2f75b9a.webm?t=1787347577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/e3f7ff0ef07e96047eae1ae2f2f75b9a.mp4?t=1787347577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear the flesh from fallen enemies to claim their abilities. Adapt mid-combat: shift into an armored brute to absorb heavy blows, transform into a warlock to shatter shields, or become a corrupted beast to inflict lethal status effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Grimdark Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/76c89f994be5f3cc3ca2bebbbd45b25b.poster.avif?t=1787347577\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/76c89f994be5f3cc3ca2bebbbd45b25b.webm?t=1787347577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/76c89f994be5f3cc3ca2bebbbd45b25b.mp4?t=1787347577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate an empire of flesh and bronze. Solve atmospheric puzzles, uncover buried secrets, and guide a party of broken companions through their own personal quests.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Limb Dismemberment &amp; Status Synergies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/056e6d1cafafe03497a5404b84955c37.poster.avif?t=1787347577\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/056e6d1cafafe03497a5404b84955c37.webm?t=1787347577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/056e6d1cafafe03497a5404b84955c37.mp4?t=1787347577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target distinct enemy limbs to disable their attacks. Build complex party synergies using stackable status effects: trigger mass bleed detonations, freeze targets solid, or unleash nukes that wipe the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal the Flesh of Your Foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/e3f7ff0ef07e96047eae1ae2f2f75b9a.poster.avif?t=1787347577\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/e3f7ff0ef07e96047eae1ae2f2f75b9a.webm?t=1787347577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/e3f7ff0ef07e96047eae1ae2f2f75b9a.mp4?t=1787347577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear the flesh from fallen enemies to claim their abilities. Adapt mid-combat: shift into an armored brute to absorb heavy blows, transform into a warlock to shatter shields, or become a corrupted beast to inflict lethal status effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Grimdark Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/76c89f994be5f3cc3ca2bebbbd45b25b.poster.avif?t=1787347577\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/76c89f994be5f3cc3ca2bebbbd45b25b.webm?t=1787347577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/extras/76c89f994be5f3cc3ca2bebbbd45b25b.mp4?t=1787347577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate an empire of flesh and bronze. Solve atmospheric puzzles, uncover buried secrets, and guide a party of broken companions through their own personal quests.</p>", "short_description": "Carnosis is a horror dungeon crawler set in a grimdark empire filled with mutated monstrosities and war machines. Sever enemy limbs, steal the flesh of defeated foes, and chain devastating status combos to butcher your way to the emperor.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/673cedb20e6186de63d8b9c7b4bb4d7d85a5539a/header.jpg?t=1787347577", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/b333a5c8a1ab6d2782c162da697f53b12083aa36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787347577", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5122100/b333a5c8a1ab6d2782c162da697f53b12083aa36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787347577", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4340 / AMD FX-6300 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 4.1 / DirectX 11 capable GPU (Intel HD Graphics 4000 or better)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Standard Audio</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 260X (2 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong>